{
 "annotations": {
  "openWorldHint": false,
  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "AI assistant traffic"
 },
 "description": "Return AI-assistant (ChatGPT/Claude/Perplexity/Gemini/Copilot) traffic. mode='referred' (default) uses the same dashboard_ai_referred RPC as the dashboard and returns page \u00d7 AI source sessions, bounce rate, revenue_jpy, last_cited_at, and previous-period values/deltas (default top 20; explicit limit opt-in; source RPC capped at 200). The response discloses omitted rows in truncated. revenue_jpy and its comparison fields are null while purchase revenue is unconfirmed; revenue_status explains the state. On a required retrieval failure, the tool returns isError=true, revenue_status='error', revenue=null and error_code='retrieval_failed'; never read it as zero. Use period='today'/'7d'/'90d' or a raw day count (1-365), or pass start_date/end_date (inclusive calendar dates in the site's time zone) and optional compare_start_date/compare_end_date. Date inputs replace period. last_cited_at is rendered in the site's time zone. mode='gaps' returns ranked missed-citation and under-monetized AI pages (default limit 10/list) and keeps its legacy period input. site_id is OPTIONAL when OAuth-authenticated. Scope is clicked citations only.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "compare_end_date": {
    "$ref": "#/properties/start_date"
   },
   "compare_start_date": {
    "$ref": "#/properties/start_date"
   },
   "end_date": {
    "$ref": "#/properties/start_date"
   },
   "limit": {
    "maximum": 1000,
    "minimum": 1,
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "mode": {
    "default": "referred",
    "enum": [
     "referred",
     "gaps"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   },
   "period": {
    "anyOf": [
     {
      "const": "today",
      "type": "string"
     },
     {
      "const": "7d",
      "type": "string"
     },
     {
      "const": "30d",
      "type": "string"
     },
     {
      "const": "90d",
      "type": "string"
     },
     {
      "maximum": 365,
      "minimum": 1,
      "type": "integer"
     }
    ],
    "default": "30d"
   },
   "site_id": {
    "format": "uuid",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "start_date": {
    "pattern": "^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "type": "object"
 },
